  "description": "You are safe inside the shining walls of Shiloh, a beautiful utopia in a sea of demons. Unruly vagrants who leave its gates are never seen again, their souls stolen away by monsters and murderers lurking in the wastelands. But not you, valued citizen, for you are smart and know the dangers! Just remember: follow the rules, stay in your caste, and when the time comes... keep your eyes shut.\n\n(Source: Webtoons)",
